  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-heating\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Heat Pump Repair and Installation in Columbia, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>A heat pump moves heat rather than generating it: out of the house in summer, into the house in winter. That design fits the Midlands better than almost any climate in the country, because mild winters keep the equipment in its efficient range nearly year round. 2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning repairs, installs, and maintains heat pumps in Columbia, SC and across the Midlands, with video-documented diagnostics and fixed pricing before work starts.</p>\n<p>The tradeoff of a heat pump is workload. The same compressor that cools from April to October heats from December to February, so the equipment accumulates run hours in both directions and rarely gets a true off season. Maintenance timing and correct sizing matter more for heat pumps here than for any other equipment type we service.</p>\n<p>Households that also have gas service can pair the two fuels through a <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc/dual-fuel-hybrid-systems\">dual fuel hybrid system</a>, and single rooms beyond the ductwork can run their own <a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc/mini-split\">ductless mini split</a>, which is itself a small heat pump. Staging and schedules are handled through a properly configured <a href=\"/services/heating-columbia-sc/smart-thermostats\">smart thermostat</a>. Schedule with 2nd Wind by phone, online, or 24/7 chat, and watch the diagnosis on video before you approve the work.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18033921513\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18033921513\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(803) 392-1513</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has--color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1919\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-Trane.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Trane Heat Pump unit on the exterior of a home.\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-Trane.jpg 1919w, /images/2024/06/A-Trane-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-Trane-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-Trane-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-Trane-1536x1025.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Heat Pump Repair</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">Heat pump failures cluster around the components that both seasons share: the compressor, the reversing valve that switches between heating and cooling, refrigerant charge, defrost controls, and the electrical parts that start the system. A heat pump stuck in one mode, blowing lukewarm air, or icing over in winter beyond its normal defrost cycle has a diagnosable cause. Our technicians test the refrigerant circuit and controls, record video of the finding, and quote the repair before work starts. Same-day emergency service is available for residential properties.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Heat Pump Installation and Replacement</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">Sizing a heat pump means satisfying two loads with one machine, so we calculate both the cooling load and the heating load and size to the pair. Supplemental electric heat covers the coldest stretches, and how it is configured matters: auxiliary heat strips cost several times more per hour to run than the compressor, so a system that leans on them unnecessarily inflates every winter bill. We set balance points and thermostat staging so the expensive heat runs only when the cheap heat cannot keep up, and we present equipment options with prices at quote time.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Heat Pump Maintenance</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p class=\"FirstParagraph\">Because a heat pump works all year, it earns both seasonal visits: refrigerant charge, coil condition, and condensate drainage before summer, then defrost operation, reversing valve function, and supplemental heat testing before winter. Both visits are covered for Cloud 10 members through our <a href=\"/maintenance\">maintenance plans</a>, with priority scheduling attached.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"428\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-1024x684.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A 2nd Wind Heating and Air Conditioning technician performing diagnostic work in Columbia, SC\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/06/A-2nd-Wind-Heating-and-Air-Conditioning-technician-performing-diagnostic-work.jpg 1916w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Guaranteed Heating Excellence in Columbia, SC</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At 2nd Wind HVAC, we guarantee heating excellence with our team of highly skilled technicians, top-tier services, and reliable, energy-efficient solutions. We prioritize your comfort and satisfaction, offering comprehensive heating repairs, installations, and maintenance for homes in Columbia, SC. Trust us for all your heating needs, ensuring a warm and comfortable environment no matter the season.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 14;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:14;\">\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Amana Heating &amp; Air Conditioning Logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png 300w, /images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-768x427.png 768w, /images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo.png 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"