3.7,0,6-2,7.4-3.8l-3-2c-0.8,1.2-2.1,2.4-4.3,2.4 c-2.5,0-3.6-1.3-4.3-2.7l11.8-4.9l-0.6-1.4C105.6,12.1,102.9,9.7,99.4,9.7L99.4,9.7z M99.6,13.1c1.6,0,2.8,0.9,3.2,1.9l-7.9,3.3 C94.6,15.7,97,13.1,99.6,13.1L99.6,13.1z\"/><path fill=\"#3CBA54\" d=\"M85.6,26.8h3.9V0.9h-3.9V26.8z\"/></svg>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text\">\n                Reviews <span class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text__stars\">★★★★★</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating\"><div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars\">\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__score\">\n                5/5\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Pam James\" aria-label=\"Pam James\">Pam James</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>I just had to replace an old HVAC system with a new one and 2nd Wind did a wonderful job with a new system, inspected it afterwards and set up another inspection with the city. All went very well and I would highly recommend them to help with any HVAC problems you might have.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Stacy Mink\" aria-label=\"Stacy Mink\">Stacy Mink</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>They were very professional and acknowledged all of my concerns in a very understanding way. Although we are undecided about moving forward with the recommendations, if, and when we do, we will definitely consider 2nd Wind for our HVAC needs!</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Warren Donaldson\" aria-label=\"Warren Donaldson\">Warren Donaldson</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>We are always very happy with the service that we get from 2nd Wind and their service technicians. They are always professional and knowledgeable about their work and products. And they’ve always given us friendly and helpful advice on care and upkeep of our air unit.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </